# Witness for EntryCheckMeetsHandOffAdmission. The edge's check is replaced by FALSE, so the
# invariant fails exactly when a kept step of its kind - a foreign stamped append - is
# reachable under every guarantee. A clean base run with this mutant red
# shows the edge was checked on real steps, not vacuously.
MODULE: EntryCheckMeetsHandOffAdmissionWitness
TARGET: EntryCheckMeetsHandOffAdmission
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a foreign stamped append is reachable: the edge's check is not vacuous

--- FIND
Fails("EntryCheckMeetsHandOffAdmission", HAllocGuard(s, HEntry("F")))
--- REPLACE
Fails("EntryCheckMeetsHandOffAdmission", FALSE)
--- END
